### Step 1: Login to get session token
POST http://localhost:8080/mediaserv/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "test1",
  "password": "test1"
}

###

### Step 2: Play media from beginning
# Plays the entire media file in chunks (default: 150000 bytes per chunk)
# Replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE with actual token from login
GET http://localhost:8080/mediaserv/playMedia?id=video-001
Cookie: token=YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Step 3: Play media from specific position (0-99999 bytes)
# Request first 100KB of media
GET http://localhost:8080/mediaserv/playMedia?id=video-001
Cookie: token=YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Range: bytes=0-99999

###

### Step 4: Play media from specific position (resume download)
# Resume from byte 500000
GET http://localhost:8080/mediaserv/playMedia?id=video-001
Cookie: token=YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Range: bytes=500000-

###

### Step 5: Play media last 100KB
# Request last 100KB of media file
GET http://localhost:8080/mediaserv/playMedia?id=video-001
Cookie: token=YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Range: bytes=-100000

###

### Step 6: Play media specific range
# Request bytes 1000000 to 1500000
GET http://localhost:8080/mediaserv/playMedia?id=video-001
Cookie: token=YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Range: bytes=1000000-1500000
